# Wall mural (R23 wall mount): a photographer firing a camera flash painted in neon spray line art across an ink plate flat on the facade, quantized from
# generated art (tools/voxel-forge/art/mural_flash.png, local ComfyUI Qwen-Image via fleet media). Two voxels deep.
grid 10
size 2 46 46
slot plate Ink
slot face Paper
slot edge PaperEdge
pivot 0 23 0
box 0 0 0 1 46 46 plate
box 1 0 0 2 46 46 plate
image ../art/mural_flash.png 1 1 1 44 44 plate 0.08 face 0.2 edge
